<title>GERMANY: Veba details sales, earnings by sector.</title>
<headline>Veba details sales, earnings by sector.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				 74,541  vs 72,372</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Electricity				15,297  vs 15,738</p>
<p>     Chemicals				  10,303  vs 10,770</p>
<p>     Oil					  17,714  vs 15,406</p>
<p>     Trade/Transport/Services	     30,876  vs 30,119</p>
<p>     Telecommunications		     351     vs 339</p>
<p>    Earnings by DVFA method		 2,491   vs 2,113</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Electricity				1,451   vs 1,024</p>
<p>     Chemicals				  460     vs 503</p>
<p>     Oil					  349     vs 208</p>
<p>     Trade/Transport/Services	     370     vs 430</p>
<p>     Telecommunications (loss)	    (208)   vs (101)</p>
<p>     Others				     69	vs 49</p>
<p>    Earnings per share by DVFA method   5.04    vs 4.33 marks</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     Electricity				2.94    vs 2.10 marks</p>
<p>     Chemicals				  0.93    vs 1.02 marks</p>
<p>     Oil					  0.70    vs 0.43  marks</p>
<p>     Trade/Transport/Services	     0.75    vs 0.88  marks</p>
<p>     Telecommunications (loss)	    (0.42)  vs (0.21)marks</p>
<p>     Others				     0.14    vs 0.10  marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified energy, chemicals and services group is Veba AG. Figures in brackets denote a loss.</p>
</text>
